@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "How to Connect to MontanaMesh";
}

<section class="app-shell page-hero reveal" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">First Radio / Local Mesh / Discord</p>
    <h1 id="connect-title">Get on the mesh.</h1>
    <p>
        Start with a supported 915 MHz radio, pair it with the Meshtastic app, and use the MontanaMesh recommendations so your first node helps the network instead of adding noise.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="app-shell step-timeline" aria-label="Connection steps">
    <article class="step-card reveal">
        <span class="card-index">01</span>
        <h2>Join the community</h2>
        <p>Most local coordination happens in the Montana Mesh Discord. It is the best place to ask what people can hear, compare devices, and plan coverage tests.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary signal-button" href="https://discord.gg/SKmsDCraTV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join Discord</a>
    </article>

    <article class="step-card reveal">
        <span class="card-index">02</span>
        <h2>Pick a radio</h2>
        <p>Match the device to the job: pocket carry, vehicle testing, window node, rooftop node, or solar relay.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Beginner:</strong> ready-to-use pocket radio or tracker.</li>
            <li><strong>Builder:</strong> Heltec, RAK, Seeed, or LILYGO board plus case, battery, and antenna.</li>
            <li><strong>Coverage:</strong> outdoor-ready low-power node mounted high.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="text-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="DeviceGuide">Open the device guide</a>
    </article>

    <article class="step-card reveal">
        <span class="card-index">03</span>
        <h2>Install the app</h2>
        <p>Use the official Meshtastic app, then pair by Bluetooth or USB depending on your device.</p>
        <div class="link-pair">
            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.geeksville.mesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Android app</a>
            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/meshtastic/id1586432531" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">iOS app</a>
        </div>
    </article>

    <article class="step-card reveal">
        <span class="card-index">04</span>
        <h2>Use clean settings</h2>
        <p>Set a useful node name, keep broadcast intervals reasonable, avoid unnecessary Router roles, and follow the local LongFast guidance.</p>
        <a class="text-link" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="RecommendedConfigurationSettings">Review recommended settings</a>
    </article>
</section>

<section class="app-shell decision-strip reveal" aria-labelledby="connect-check-title">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">First Test</p>
        <h2 id="connect-check-title">Can anyone hear you?</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-list">
        <p>Put the radio near a window or outside with a clear view of the sky and nearby terrain.</p>
        <p>Send a short test message and watch for replies, traceroutes, or new nodes in the app.</p>
        <p>Check the live map, then ask in Discord if you are not seeing local traffic yet.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="app-shell route-rail reveal" aria-labelledby="connect-next-title">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Build From Here</p>
        <h2 id="connect-next-title">Make your node more useful.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="route-list">
        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="HostNode">
            <span>Host a node</span>
            <small>Use a better location to improve shared MontanaMesh coverage.</small>
        </a>
        <a href="https://meshmonitor.montanamesh.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Open the live map</span>
            <small>See nearby nodes and current network activity.</small>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
